# Add reproducible Spanish spelling validation

## Objective

Pin a licensed Spanish dictionary and extend CSpell to the complete Spanish
research corpus without generating a dictionary from the corpus itself.

## Acceptance

- Dictionary identity, version, license, and origin are recorded.
- Existing Spanish content is checked rather than globally ignored.
- Research terminology uses narrow, reviewed additions.
- Owning validation gates pass.

## Evidence

- The initial Jig adoption validates English governance surfaces only.
